            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство:  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1-\\sqrt{1-4\\log_8^{2} x}}{\\log_8 x}\\lt 2\"></span>. </p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T01:30:33.691575+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4};1)\\cup (1;\\sqrt{8})\"></span> . </p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T01:30:33.691575+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>После за­ме­ны <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\log_8 x\"></span> по­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1-\\sqrt{1-4t^{2}}-2t}{t}\\lt 0\"></span>.  Зна­чит,</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-4t^{2}}-2t\\gt 0\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\"></span>      или      <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-4t^{2}}-2t\\lt 0\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\"></span> </p></center><p>Решим первую си­сте­му не­ра­венств:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-4t^{2}}-2t\\gt 0\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}1-4t^{2}\\lt 4t^{2}-4t+1\\\\4t^{2}\\le 1\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff -\\frac{1}{2}\\le t\\lt 0\"></span> . </p></center><p>Воз­вра­ща­ясь к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{1}{2}\\le \\log_8 x\\lt 0\\iff \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\le x\\lt 1\"></span>. </p></center><p>Решим вто­рую си­сте­му не­ра­венств:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-4t^{2}}-2t\\lt 0\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}1-4t^{2}\\gt 4t^{2}-4t+1\\\\4t^{2}\\le 1\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\\iff 0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{2}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Воз­вра­ща­ясь к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt \\log_8 x\\lt \\frac{1}{2}\\iff 1\\lt x\\lt \\sqrt{8}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, ре­ше­ни­ем ис­ход­но­го не­ра­вен­ства яв­ля­ет­ся мно­же­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4};1)\\cup (1;\\sqrt{8})\"></span> . </p>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
