            "html": "<p>После за­ме­ны <span data-inline-latex=\"t=2\\log_2 x\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1-\\sqrt{1-2t^{2}}-t}{t}\\lt 0\"></span>.  Зна­чит,</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-2t^{2}}-t\\gt 0\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\"></span>   или   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}1-\\sqrt{1-2t^{2}}-t\\lt 0\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\"></span> </p></center><p>Решим первую си­сте­му не­ра­венств:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\sqrt{1-2t^{2}}\\lt 1-t\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}1-2t^{2}\\lt t^{2}-2t+1\\\\2t^{2}\\le 1\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}t(3t-2)\\gt 0\\\\-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\le t\\le \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\le t\\lt 0\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>Воз­вра­ща­ясь к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\le 2\\log_2 x\\lt 0\\iff 2^{-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}}\\le x\\lt 1\"></span> </p></center><p>Решим вто­рую си­сте­му не­ра­венств:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\sqrt{1-2t^{2}}\\gt 1-t\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}1-2t^{2}\\gt t^{2}-2t+1\\\\2t^{2}\\le 1\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{2}{3}\\\\-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\le t\\le \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\\\t\\gt 0\\end{cases}\\iff 0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{2}{3}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>Воз­вра­ща­ясь к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt 2\\log_2 x\\lt \\frac{2}{3}\\iff 1\\lt x\\lt 2^{\\frac{1}{3}}\"></span> </p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, по­лу­ча­ем, что ре­ше­ни­ем ис­ход­но­го не­ра­вен­ства яв­ля­ет­ся мно­же­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"[2^{-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}};1)\\cup (1;2^{\\frac{1}{3}})\"></span> . </p>",
            "title": "Решение",
            "asset_keys": [],
            "section_id": "solution:1",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          }
